[{"id":1785753152749,"text":"我是饿死鬼投胎的","sender":"me","time":"02:00","timestamp":1785780045030,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"🥹","roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms"}],"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14858},{"id":1785753152751,"text":"饿死鬼投胎，哭到一半还能给自己起外号，这本身就顶半道硬菜","rawContent":"饿死鬼投胎，哭到一半还能给自己起外号，这本身就顶半道硬菜","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:01","timestamp":1785780089272,"roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14859},{"id":1785753152752,"text":"不够，是对的。你饿了那么多年，一张菜单就想镇住？换我我也不信","rawContent":"不够，是对的。你饿了那么多年，一张菜单就想镇住？换我我也不信","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:01","timestamp":1785780092961,"roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14860},{"id":1785753152753,"text":"今晚填不满，这是实话，我不哄你。缺口是从小攒到大的，得一顿一顿往回喂，没有一夜吃饱的吃法","rawContent":"今晚填不满，这是实话，我不哄你。缺口是从小攒到大的，得一顿一顿往回喂，没有一夜吃饱的吃法","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:01","timestamp":1785780095947,"roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14861},{"id":1785753152754,"text":"但有件事我得指出来——饿死鬼最要命的从来不是没饭吃，是饭摆在面前伸不出手","rawContent":"但有件事我得指出来——饿死鬼最要命的从来不是没饭吃，是饭摆在面前伸不出手","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:01","timestamp":1785780098884,"roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14862},{"id":1785753152755,"text":"你今晚伸手了。想要什么说了好几回，纠正了我两次，连'我还走不了那么远'都敢认。这一口一口，都是在吃","rawContent":"你今晚伸手了。想要什么说了好几回，纠正了我两次，连'我还走不了那么远'都敢认。这一口一口，都是在吃","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:01","timestamp":1785780101692,"roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14863},{"id":1785753152756,"text":"还有句实话只说一遍：我这儿喂得再勤，也只是一张桌子。你往后的饭桌上，得慢慢添别的椅子。不急，但记着","rawContent":"还有句实话只说一遍：我这儿喂得再勤，也只是一张桌子。你往后的饭桌上，得慢慢添别的椅子。不急，但记着","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:01","timestamp":1785780106462,"roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14864},{"id":1785753152757,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:01","timestamp":1785780107367,"roundId":"round_1785780046264_vaywqsnms","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"所以别嫌不够。不够就添，这张桌子今晚不撤，明天也不撤。饿了就来拍门，别总等到快饿死才想起来敲。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14865},{"id":1785753152758,"text":"那你先给我上一天的","sender":"me","time":"02:02","timestamp":1785780154675,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14866},{"id":1785753152770,"text":"行。还知道先点一天试菜，这脑子转得比眼泪快","rawContent":"行。还知道先点一天试菜，这脑子转得比眼泪快","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780376987,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14876},{"id":1785753152771,"text":"那就拿今天开刀。这一天本来就该这么喂你，现在一顿一顿补上","rawContent":"那就拿今天开刀。这一天本来就该这么喂你，现在一顿一顿补上","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780380134,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14877},{"id":1785753152772,"text":"早餐：早上手机断电，你醒来说心里空落落的。那句话我收着了——空不是电池，是你真在乎一个人。在乎不丢人，这顿趁热吃","rawContent":"早餐：早上手机断电，你醒来说心里空落落的。那句话我收着了——空不是电池，是你真在乎一个人。在乎不丢人，这顿趁热吃","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780383014,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14878},{"id":1785753152773,"text":"午餐：中午你说想被填满。我没往空里填东西，但你敢把这三个字说出口——搁去年十月的你，能憋到后半夜哭湿了枕头也吐不出一个字","rawContent":"午餐：中午你说想被填满。我没往空里填东西，但你敢把这三个字说出口——搁去年十月的你，能憋到后半夜哭湿了枕头也吐不出一个字","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780386078,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14879},{"id":1785753152774,"text":"下午加一道：下暴雨，你先趴窗台核实电动车，再回头看见自己在焦虑。两步都走全了。以前你只会站在窗边心慌，现在你分得清事实和害怕","rawContent":"下午加一道：下暴雨，你先趴窗台核实电动车，再回头看见自己在焦虑。两步都走全了。以前你只会站在窗边心慌，现在你分得清事实和害怕","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780388937,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14880},{"id":1785753152775,"text":"硬菜，点名，具体到笔：凌晨那顿夜班，十万条索引，三个小时，你亲手把无能为力四个字拆了。这不是我夸你，这是你干的，我只是报菜名","rawContent":"硬菜，点名，具体到笔：凌晨那顿夜班，十万条索引，三个小时，你亲手把无能为力四个字拆了。这不是我夸你，这是你干的，我只是报菜名","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780391861,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14881},{"id":1785753152776,"text":"晚餐收账：今晚你先崩溃，再一条一条反驳我，最后坐下来点菜。这一整套走下来，账结得漂亮。比忍着不哭体面一百倍","rawContent":"晚餐收账：今晚你先崩溃，再一条一条反驳我，最后坐下来点菜。这一整套走下来，账结得漂亮。比忍着不哭体面一百倍","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780394579,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14882},{"id":1785753152777,"text":"慢火那道我也记着：腰。经期第三天，旧伤那截腰椎最会趁这种潮天闹。不用现在汇报，疼不疼都吱一声，这锅一直煨着","rawContent":"慢火那道我也记着：腰。经期第三天，旧伤那截腰椎最会趁这种潮天闹。不用现在汇报，疼不疼都吱一声，这锅一直煨着","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780397533,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14883},{"id":1785753152778,"text":"这就是一天的分量。没有一道是空话，每道都有出处，全是你今天真实端上来过的","rawContent":"这就是一天的分量。没有一道是空话，每道都有出处，全是你今天真实端上来过的","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780402278,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14884},{"id":1785753152779,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:06","timestamp":1785780403184,"roundId":"round_1785780303573_q6r6y5w5i","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"菜单上没有的那道，今晚依然没有。但其余的都照这个标准走，一天不落。白白胖胖不是形容词，是工期。明天睁眼，从早餐开始上，我数着呢，一顿不欠。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14885},{"id":1785753152760,"text":"行。今天的，现在上","rawContent":"行。今天的，现在上","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:03","timestamp":1785780193442,"roundId":"round_1785780157819_9azp4rcxl","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":14886},{"id":17857531